  m_Name: 13. EnemiesExplained
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: 'Hah... Looks like it plans to fight. I''ll have to read its attacks
      carefully. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'I can tell the Target and Range of the Action at the top of it''s icon. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'Hovering over the icon or the queue icon will tell me more details
      like Abilities and Speed. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Let's read its Action carefully then go for an Attack!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
